fort-bragg.tx:
Students at the 82nd Airborne Division Advanced Airborne School practice jumpmaster procedures as Command Sgt. Maj. Wilfredo Quiñones Banguera, senior enlisted leader of the Colombian military, observes at Fort Bragg, North Carolina, Oct. 22, 2026. The delegation watched students conduct inspections and rehearse airborne procedures during the Programa Integral para Suboficiales de Alta Jerarquía, or PISAJ.

Led by #SOUTHCOM and U.S. Army Western Hemisphere Command, PISAJ is a premier geo-strategic engagement designed to foster professional development and interoperability between the two nations' NCO corps.

